BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Science-Based Strategies to Support Your Immune System
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260922T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260922T200000
DTSTAMP:20260825T060957Z
UID:198f8cc9a8b9603c@gid-seminars.wnprc.wisc.edu
CATEGORIES:Class/Seminar
DESCRIPTION:The immune system is a remarkably complex network of organs\, 
 cells\, and chemical messengers that protects us from infection every day.
  Yet we're constantly bombarded with products\, remedies\, and online advi
 ce claiming to "boost" immunity. How can you tell what's supported by scie
 nce — and what's simply marketing?\n\nIn this noontime webinar\, you'll 
 learn how the immune system works\, how it changes as we age\, and what li
 festyle habits truly support immune health. We'll separate fact from ficti
 on as we examine the evidence behind nutrition\, exercise\, sleep\, stress
  management\, supplements\, and other popular immune remedies.\n\nYou'll a
 lso discover why vaccines work differently from remedies that claim to "bo
 ost" immunity\, how they train the immune system to recognize specific thr
 eats\, and why vaccination remains one of the most effective tools for pre
 venting serious infectious diseases.\n\nYou'll leave with practical\, evid
 ence-based strategies you can use right away — and a clearer understandi
 ng of what really supports a healthy immune system.\n\nThis class will be 
 recorded and a one-week link to the recording will be shared with all regi
 stered participants. \n\nTo receive incentive points\, attend at least 80%
  of the live session or listen to the entire recording within one week.  
 \n\nRequest disability accommodations and access info.\n\nClass details ar
 e subject to change.\n\nEvent URL: https://events.stanford.edu/event/scien
 ce-based-strategies-to-support-your-immune-system\n\nSource: stanford_virt
 ual
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/science-based-strategies-to-support-
 your-immune-system
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Reminder: Science-Based Strategies to Support Your Immune Syst
 em
TRIGGER:-PT1H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
